444	          The amount must be a number with up to two decimals, and the date a calendar date not in a closed
445	          period nor after the person's retirement date; a negative amount is a correction and must name, by
446	          number, a settled claim of this person (only a correction may); only a draft claim can be edited.
447	        </span>
448	      )}
449	    </form>
450	  );
451	}
